  "description": "The player I created in a soccer game is now playing professionally in real life?! Kim Saeng-Seong suddenly appeared like a comet one day. In reality, he's a \"generated\" player created by agent Seong-Je in a soccer game. Is this player a gift from God, a revivalist for his failing agency, or a terrifying prospect? \n\nI don't know for now, but let's give it a try.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
